When choosing architecture, prefer evidence in tree over new patterns. Invariants: `architecture.mdc`. SLAs: `core.mdc`.

## Rejected for production hot path

| Alternative | Why not |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Jump Consistent Hash** | Large remap on scale; tests/benches only |
| **Redis Cluster** | `MOVED` breaks multi-key Lua; operator-led static slots instead |
| **Kafka/NATS on `/track`** | No atomic budget+accept; appliance footprint |
| **Lua `XADD` in same script as debit** | Holds Redis thread; split to Go StreamProducer + rollback |
| **LISTEN/NOTIFY for outbox** | Polling 20 ms chosen for reliability under load |
| **Dragonfly/Aerospike v1** | Redis masters + Sentinel sufficient for appliance |

## Local quanta and broker (detail)

Goals: cut Redis stream RAM, crash-safe replay, controlled cutover with PEL drain. Scope: append-only segments + gnet server — not general message bus. Budget/settlement may stay on Redis Streams until broker `_pg` path proven.

## Local quanta trade-off

Full-skip = zero sync `EVALSHA` for eligible traffic; eventual consistency on crash — refill/return scripts reconcile. Coordinate stream keys when `StreamProducer` active to prevent dual `XADD`.

## unsafe.String

Lifetime ≤ gnet read frame. Copy `Accept`/`Origin` and event strings before async write from filter goroutine.

## Verification matrix (must cite tests when claiming behavior)

| Behavior | Test / gate |
| :--- | :--- |
| Admission race without reserve | `TestStreamProducerAdmissionRaceWithoutReserve` |
| Reserve prevents queue full | `TestStreamProducerReservePreventsQueueFull` |
| Dual stream write fix | `TestUnifiedFilter_SetDeferStreamToProducer_DualStreamWriteFix` |
| Post-debit rollback | `TestUnifiedFilter_RollbackDebit_LocalQuanta` |
| Static slot parity | `sharding_test.go`, edge Lua |
| Budget invariant | `AssertBudgetInvariant` |
| UDS dial | `redis_uds_benchmark.sh` |

Operator signals: `ad_stream_producer_post_debit_rejected_total` ≈ 0; spike → tune admission or capacity.

